WEBVTT

00:07:26.208 --> 00:07:31.059
it also leads to arrogance and hubris.

00:07:31.083 --> 00:07:36.643
And this hubris was best captured
in a very famous essay

00:07:36.667 --> 00:07:38.809
by Francis Fukuyama

00:07:38.833 --> 00:07:41.083
called "The End of History?"

00:07:42.083 --> 00:07:48.059
Now, Fukuyama was putting across
a very sophisticated message,

00:07:48.083 --> 00:07:51.643
but all that the West
heard from this essay

00:07:51.667 --> 00:07:55.559
was that we, the liberal democracies,

00:07:55.583 --> 00:07:57.434
we have succeeded,

00:07:57.458 --> 00:07:59.143
we don't have to change,

00:07:59.167 --> 00:08:00.434
we don't have to adapt,